{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415036","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415036","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041503601:1":{"text":"呀呼！非常荣幸见到您，伟大的蛮血战神！","source_cn":"呀呼！非常荣幸见到您，伟大的蛮血战神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35302787E1945D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503602:1":{"text":"我们百战百胜，所向披靡的——布鲁特斯大人！","source_cn":"我们百战百胜，所向披靡的——布鲁特斯大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72D2F895605B3E1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503603:1":{"text":"……咳咳，冷静点，曼卡拉。","source_cn":"……咳咳，冷静点，曼卡拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB0870772672574F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503604:1":{"text":"现在不是战歌节，这里也不是沙漠，大喊大叫只会让人侧目。","source_cn":"现在不是战歌节，这里也不是沙漠，大喊大叫只会让人侧目。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656D0E9976D03F53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503605:1":{"text":"而且，这种放松的环境，就不用再叫什么战神了。","source_cn":"而且，这种放松的环境，就不用再叫什么战神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B194FA9A958D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7